les with short description Short description is different from Wikidata Articles with hAudio microformats Album articles lacking alt text"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d02", "start": 0, "end": 416, "text": "UK 1997 `` Until I Find You Again '' 42 3 44 Personnel [ edit ] Richard Marx – lead vocals , backing vocals ( 1–5 , 7–12 ) , keyboards ( 1 , 6 , 7 , 8 , 11 ) , digital piano ( 1 ) , synth kalimba ( 2 ) , acoustic guitar ( 5 ) , acoustic piano ( 12 ) Greg Phillinganes – keyboards ( 2 ) , Rhodes ( 5 , 11 ) John Lehmkuhl – synthesizer programming ( 3 ) Tom Keane – Rhodes ( 4 ) Simon Franglen – Synclavier programming"}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d03", "start": 0, "end": 153, "text": "Flesh and Bone (film) Flesh and Bone is a 1993 neo noir film drama written and directed by Steve Kloves that stars Meg Ryan, Dennis Quaid and James Caan."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d03", "start": 154, "end": 199, "text": "Gwyneth Paltrow is featured in an early role."}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d03", "start": 200, "end": 374, "text": "Janet Maslin of \"The New York Times\" described Paltrow as a scene-stealer \"who is Blythe Danner's daughter and has her mother's way of making a camera fall in love with her.\""}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d03", "start": 375, "end": 439, "text": "A family in rural Texas finds a boy, Arlis, who says he is lost."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d03", "start": 440, "end": 507, "text": "They take him into their home, feed him, and give a place to sleep."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d03", "start": 508, "end": 525, "text": "But the boy later"}, "D5S1": {"document_number": 5, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0372-787771af95f1:d04", "start": 0, "end": 133, "text": "Flesh and Bone ( film ) -